aking soda]] \n* ½ teaspoon [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n* 5 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tablespoons]] [[Cookbook:Butter|butter]] \n* 1 cup [[Cookbook:Sour Cream|sour cream]] \n* 1 [[Cookbook:Egg Yolk|egg yolk]] \n* ½ cup [[Cookbook:Fireweed|fireweed]] blossoms \n\n== Procedure ==\n# Mix dry ingredients together.  \n# Cut the butter into five pieces and cut into dry ingredients until crumbly.  \n# Mix sour cream and egg yolk together, and mix with dry ingredients until all ingredients are combined. [[Cookbook:Dough|Dough]] will be sticky.  \n# Turn dough out onto a floured surface and sprinkle blossoms on top.\n# [[Cookbook:Kneading|Knead]] lightly (only about 10 times) to mix flowers in.  \n# Pat out into a square about ¾ [[Cookbook:Inch|inch]] thick.  \n# Cut into 4 squares, and cut each square diagonally to make 8 scones.\n# [[Cookbook:Baking|Bake]] at {{#invoke:temperature|f|400}} for 12 to 15 minutes. \n\n[[Category:Recipes for scones|{{PAGENAME}}]]\n[[Category:Recipes using butter]]\n[[Category:Recipes using baking powder]]\n[[Category:Recipes using baking soda]]\n[[Category:Recipes using white sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using egg yolk]]\n[[Category:Recipes using fireweed]]\n[[Category:Recipes using all-purpose flour]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Fireweed Scones","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"2 cups all-purpose flour","sourceText":"2 cups all-purpose flour","amountText":"2 cups all-purpose flour","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"¼ cup white granulated sugar","sourceText":"¼ cup white granulated sugar","amountText":"¼ cup white granulated sugar","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"2 teaspoons baking powder","sourceText":"2 teaspoons baking powder","amountText":"2 teaspoons baking powder","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"½ teaspoon baking soda","sourceText":"½ teaspoon ba